OL,3,GNEWSAFears over 'deeply impacting'
OL,4,A20-mile works diversion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man says his family faces more than
OL,7,F180 miles (290km) of added travel a
OL,8,Fweek for his children's school run due
OL,9,Fto roadworks which are set to last 12
OL,10,Fweeks.
OL,12,FParts of the A225 Dartford Road in
OL,13,FHorton Kirby near Dartford will be
OL,14,Fclosed between January and March for
OL,15,Fgas company SGN to replace a mains
OL,16,Fpipe.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
