OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1794572771
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFears over 'deeply impacting'
OL,4,A20-mile works diversion
OL,5,
OL,6,FResident Charles Devine says the
OL,7,Fclosure will add over 20 miles (32.1km)
OL,8,Feach way to the school run and worries
OL,9,Fhis wife could be late for work, while
OL,10,Fothers are raising fears they could
OL,11,Ffeel the pinch amid high fuel prices.
OL,13,FAn SGN spokesperson said it "recognises
OL,14,Fthe impact" that works might cause,
OL,15,Fwhile Kent County Council said closures
OL,16,Fwere sometimes "the only safe way" to
OL,17,Fcarry out works.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
